{"word":"ταραχή","uri":"tarachê","senses":[{"word":"ταραχή","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ταραχή,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ῆς</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ἡ</span>) [<span class=\"grec\">ᾰᾰ</span>]\ntrouble, désordre :\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">au\nphysique,</span> trouble (du ventre, de l’estomac, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Hpc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Coac.</span> <span class=\"refch\">151</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> trouble de l’esprit,\n<span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">7, 55 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Isocr.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">16</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ;\n<span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">φόϐος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 79 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. d’une armée,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 126 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 77 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 5, 27,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> trouble politique,\nagitation, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3,\n150 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 162 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ταραχὴν παρέχειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Phæd.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">66</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, causer du trouble ;\n<span class=\"grec\">πολλὴν ἔχειν ταραχήν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 8, 12,</span> éprouver un grand trouble ; <span class=\"ital\">au plur.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">301, 11,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"